        "alt_text": "Quote graphic featuring a statement by Acting NASA Administrator Janet Petro. The background is white with the NASA Insignia in the top center. The quote, in dark blue text, reads, \"Today’s successful launch of SpaceX’s Fram2 mission marks a significant step forward in our understanding of human health in space. The planned research, from maintaining muscle mass to the pioneering unassisted exit after landing, promises invaluable insights for future missions, pushing the boundaries of what's possible in space exploration.\" At the bottom of the graphic is a red line and Janet Petro’s name and title in dark blue. A faint, circular NASA seal is visible behind the text.\n\nCredit: NASA",
